{
  "title": "Dua for Istekhaarah fom Holy Quran",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "It is worth mentioning that ‘Allamah al-Majlisi has reported from some books written by our scholars on the authority of a book handwritten by Shaykh Yusuf al-Usmani on the authority of a book handwritten by Ayatollah ‘Allamah who said that Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.) is reported to have said:\nIf you intend for Istekhaarah from the Mighty Book (i.e. the Holy Qur’an), you may say this supplicatory prayer:\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّ حْمٰنِ الرَّ حِيْمِ \nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEME\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful. \nاِنْ كَانَ فِىْ قَضَاۤئِكَ وَقَدَرِكَ اَنْتَمُنَّ \nIN KAANA FEE QAZAAA-EKA WA QADAREKA AN TAMUNNA \nIf it is within Your decree and Your destiny to bestow favor \nعَلٰى شِيْعَةِ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ \nA’LAA SHEE-A’TE AALE MOHAMMADIN A’LAYHEMUS SALAAMO \nupon the followers (Shia) of the family of Muhammad—peace be upon them—\nبِفَرَجِ وَلِيِّكَ وَ حُجَّتِكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ \nBE-FARAJE WALIYYEKA WA HUJJATEKA A’LAA KHALQEKA \nwith the relief of Your representative and Your Proof over Your creation, \nفَاَخْرِجْ اِلَيْنَاۤ اٰيَةً مِنْ كِتَابِكَ نَسْتَدِلُّ بِهَا عَلٰى ذٰلِكَ.\nFA-AKHRIJ ELAYNAA AAYATAN MIN KETAABEKA NASTADILLO BEHAA A’LAA ZAALEKA.\nthen bring forth to us a sign from Your Book by which we may find evidence of that.\nYou may then open the copy of the Holy Qur’an, count six pages, count six lines of the seventh page, and see what is written therein.”"
}
